# Relative paths (or shell globs) excluded from the full sweep.
# One pattern per line.  '#' comments and blank lines are ignored.
#
# In-tree duplicates (screenshot regression + make test already cover these):
yarc/yarc.j64
jagniccc2000/jagniccc.j64
#
# Prefer Model-M / vj pads: drop _K / _k siblings when a Model-M or
# un-suffixed sibling is selected by run.sh's prefer-pad logic.  Explicit
# skips below catch cases where only the K variant should be ignored even
# if dedupe misses them (e.g. differently named pairs).
#
# BootIntros that need a real Model-M BIOS under HLE are recorded as FAIL
# in BASELINE.txt rather than skipped — so a future BIOS-path improvement
# can flip FAIL -> PASS without changing this list.
